# SHA-256 checksums for the bundled local embedding model (US4), pinned per
# the indexing delivery plan's Assumption 4: the Dockerfile's
# `embedding-model` build stage downloads each of these files from
# https://huggingface.co/Qdrant/all-MiniLM-L6-v2-onnx (pinned to commit
# 5f1b8cd78bc4fb444dd171e59b18f3a3af89a079, not a mutable branch ref — see
# the Dockerfile) and runs `sha256sum -c` against this file, failing the
# image build on any mismatch. Regenerate by re-downloading at a new pinned
# commit and re-running `sha256sum *` in that directory — never hand-edit a
# hash without re-verifying the actual bytes.
#
# See adapter/embedding/local_onnx.py's module docstring for why this
# specific Hugging Face repo (fastembed's own registry source for
# `sentence-transformers/all-MiniLM-L6-v2`, per that module's own
# verification) is the pinned source, not a differently-structured mirror
# such as Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2.
